### 3️⃣ **theme.css** - Kevyt tyyli
```css
.site-header,.site-footer{border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5}
.container{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px}
.header-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:64px}
.main-nav ul{display:flex;gap:20px;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.header-actions{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center}
.locale-switcher{position:relative}
.locale-switcher summary{cursor:pointer}
.locale-switcher ul{position:absolute;right:0;top:100%;background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd;list-style:none;margin:8px 0 0;padding:8px}
.site-footer .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1.5fr;gap:24px;padding:32px 0}
.site-footer h5{margin:0 0 8px}
.site-footer ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.site-footer ul li{margin:6px 0}
@media (max-width:900px){.site-footer .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.main-nav ul{gap:12px}}
@media (max-width:600px){.site-footer .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.header-bar{flex-wrap:wrap}}
```

### 4️⃣ **SEO-metat** - theme.liquid <head>
```liquid
{% if localization.language.iso_code == 'fi' %}
  <title>HerbSpot – Euroopan luotetuin kasvipohjaisen hyvinvoinnin kohde</title>
  <meta name="description" content="CE-sertifioidut 510-yhteensopivat laitteet ja tarvikkeet. Nopea EU-toimitus. Valtuutettu jälleenmyyjä.">
{% elsif localization.language.iso_code == 'ru' %}
  <title>HerbSpot — Надёжный европейский центр ботанического велнеса</title>
  <meta name="description" content="CE-сертифицированные 510-совместимые устройства и аксессуары. Быстрая доставка по ЕС. Официальный дистрибьютор.">
{% else %}
  <title>HerbSpot — Europe's Trusted Destination for Botanical Wellness</title>
  <meta name="description" content="CE-certified 510-compatible devices and accessories. Fast EU shipping. Authorized distributor.">
{% endif %}

<link rel="alternate" hreflang="fi" href="{{ shop.locale_urls.fi }}" />
<link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="{{ shop.locale_urls.en }}" />
<link rel="alternate" hreflang="ru" href="{{ shop.locale_urls.ru }}" />
<link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href="{{ routes.root_url }}" />
```

## 🚀 **ASENNUSOHJEET:**

1. **Kopioi** `header.liquid` → Shopify theme header
2. **Kopioi** `footer.liquid` → Shopify theme footer  
3. **Lisää CSS** → `theme.css`
4. **Lisää SEO-metat** → `theme.liquid` <head>
5. **Aktivoi lokaalit:** fi, en, ru Shopify Adminissa

